  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297259/Spheres-Apocrypha-Cohorts-and-Companions?affiliate_id=549120\">Spheres Apocrypha: Cohorts &amp; Companions</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Conjuration sphere (Spell Conduit).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your ability to channel spells through your companion is expanded. While your companion is within range of your Spell Conduit ability, you can treat it as the point of origin for any spell that you cast.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/companion-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
